id: pm-web-native-mutations
title: Route native backend mutations and durable idempotency through SDK capabilities
description: Remaining mutation slice of roadmap #260; account and share storage remains separate from item authority.
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[1]: backend-roadmap
