acceptance_criteria: "Route item writes, settings, decisions and durable idempotency through the selected upstream SDK capabilities; preserve atomic preconditions and normalized input semantics; conformance covers two real OS writers on one native backend, restart, duplicate retries and conflicting edits; prove tenant isolation, edit permission and access revocation; no filesystem mirror or web-account database substitution for authoritative PM storage."
